# Software Review. Textbase for Humanities Applications: WordCruncher.

**Authors:** Olsen, Mark

## Abstract
Evaluates WordCruncher, a &quot;text indexing and retrieval&quot; system aimed at manipulating large bodies of text. States that it offers an intriguing method of organizing and analyzing text on a large scale. Concludes that this IBM PC/AT compatible product is, with minor exceptions, well designed. (GEA)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ364325

